WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.717
Good afternoon! Who are you?

2
00:00:11.718 --> 00:00:16.580
I'm called a white rhinoceros.

3
00:00:16.581 --> 00:00:21.859
But white rhinos are actually gray.

4
00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:26.561
We're very big land mammals.

5
00:00:26.562 --> 00:00:29.293
Where do you live?

6
00:00:29.294 --> 00:00:34.958
Most white rhinos live in South Africa.

7
00:00:34.959 --> 00:00:39.064
We like grassy plains.

8
00:00:39.065 --> 00:00:42.513
Do you eat grasses?

9
00:00:42.514 --> 00:00:47.554
Yes. White rhinos eat grasses.

10
00:00:47.555 --> 00:00:54.777
Our mouths are very wide.

11
00:00:54.778 --> 00:01:01.268
So we can eat a lot at once!

12
00:01:01.269 --> 00:01:07.028
Why do you roll in mud?

13
00:01:07.029 --> 00:01:12.013
Mud protects us from the hot sun.

14
00:01:12.014 --> 00:01:16.244
And it keeps bugs away.

15
00:01:16.245 --> 00:01:23.722
I like your horns!

16
00:01:23.723 --> 00:01:28.679
White rhinos have two horns.

17
00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:33.225
We use them to fight.

18
00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:37.986
Oh! Do you have many enemies?

19
00:01:37.987 --> 00:01:43.323
White rhinos fight each other sometimes.

20
00:01:43.324 --> 00:01:47.819
But people are our main enemy.

21
00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:51.683
They hunt us for our horns.

22
00:01:51.684 --> 00:01:55.527
Do you ever run?

23
00:01:55.528 --> 00:02:01.141
Sometimes white rhinos run very fast.

24
00:02:01.142 --> 00:02:05.270
We charge at things!

25
00:02:05.271 --> 00:02:13.086
But we're too big to run for long.

26
00:02:13.087 --> 00:02:16.767
The sun feels hot.

27
00:02:16.768 --> 00:02:22.759
I'm going to rest in the shade now.

28
00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:29.607
Bye, Rhinoceros!

